 # Provider billing
 
 The push provider bills per call, not per notification.
-A burst of 1,000 notifications costs 10 calls; each partial batch costs one more.
+A burst of 1,000 notifications costs 4 calls; each partial batch costs one more.
 Invoices arrive on the first working day of each month.
--- a/docs/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/notifications.md
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 # Notifications
 
-The batcher sends up to 100 notifications in one provider call.
+The batcher sends up to 250 notifications in one provider call.
 A partial batch is flushed after 60 seconds, so a notification is never held longer than a minute.
 
 The push provider accepts at most 500 notifications per call and 20 calls a second per app.
